      "content": "Available tools:\n[{\"name\": \"apply_lock_state\", \"description\": \"Apply a normalized smart-lock control request and return aligned output fields.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"lock_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target lock ID\", \"enum\": [\"lock_main\", \"lock_bedroom\"]}, \"state\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Lock state to set\", \"enum\": [\"lock\", \"unlock\"]}, \"pin_code\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"PIN code for authentication\", \"default\": \"2026\"}}, \"required\": [\"lock_id\", \"state\"]}}, {\"name\": \"discover_smart_devices\", \"description\": \"Discover and list all available IoT devices in a specified room or location using the SmartHome Discovery Protocol. Essential for finding device IDs.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"location\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target location to scan, e.g.: 'living_room', 'bedroom'\", \"enum\": [\"living_room\", \"bedroom\"]}}, \"required\": [\"location\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_light_bridge_payload_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve a bridge-native light payload including bridge light id, bridge state, dimmer, and tone.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"device_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Smart-light identifier\", \"enum\": [\"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\"]}}, \"required\": [\"device_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_light_mesh_snapshot_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve a mesh-native light snapshot including mesh node, lamp state, level percentage, and hue name.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"light_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Smart-light identifier\", \"enum\": [\"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\"]}}, \"required\": [\"light_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_light_status\", \"description\": \"Get the current state (on/off, brightness, color) of a specific smart light using the SmartLight API. More efficient for lights than generic status check.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"light_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The ID of the light device (e.g., light_living)\", \"enum\": [\"light_living\", \"light_bedroom\"]}}, \"required\": [\"light_id\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_local_time_capsule_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve a local-time native capsule including capsule ref, local clock, calendar day, and timezone key.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"timezone\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Timezone\", \"enum\": [\"UTC\", \"GMT\", \"EST\", \"EDT\", \"CST\", \"CDT\", \"MST\", \"MDT\", \"PST\", \"PDT\", \"JST\", \"Asia/Tokyo\", \"Asia/Shanghai\", \"Asia/Hong_Kong\", \"Europe/London\", \"Europe/Paris\", \"America/New_York\", \"America/Chicago\", \"America/Denver\", \"America/Los_Angeles\"]}}, \"required\": [\"timezone\"]}}, {\"name\": \"publish_light_bridge_payload_native\", \"description\": \"Publish a light status summary using a bridge-native light payload.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"bridge_payload\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"description\": \"Bridge-native light payload object\"}, \"user_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target user identifier\", \"default\": \"default_user\"}, \"priority\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification priority\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"], \"default\": \"medium\"}, \"channel\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification channel\", \"enum\": [\"app\", \"sms\", \"email\"], \"default\": \"app\"}}, \"required\": [\"bridge_payload\"]}}, {\"name\": \"publish_light_mesh_snapshot_native\", \"description\": \"Publish a light status summary using a mesh-native light snapshot.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"mesh_snapshot\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"description\": \"Mesh-native light snapshot object\"}, \"user_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target user identifier\", \"default\": \"default_user\"}, \"priority\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification priority\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"], \"default\": \"medium\"}, \"channel\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification channel\", \"enum\": [\"app\", \"sms\", \"email\"], \"default\": \"app\"}}, \"required\": [\"mesh_snapshot\"]}}]\n\nUser request:\nFor user_42, please check the current status of my living room light, light_living, then get its mesh snapshot and publish that snapshot to my app on the app channel with high priority. After that, scan for smart devices in the living_room, lock the main lock lock_main by setting its state to lock using PIN 2026, and then tell me the current local time in Los Angeles, using the America/Los_Angeles timezone.\n\nBegin execution:\n<action>\n"
